Legacy admitted only inpatient claims and flagged ER/OR outpatient claims into the pool. The new grouper starts from all medical claims (claim_type_cd = 1), identifies inpatient by std_place_group 1/2/3, identifies ER/OR by revenue code, place of service 23 or procedure group 111, adds telehealth, and includes LTC unless excluded by parameter. Expect more claims and dollars per admission; ER inclusion at the stay boundary can differ.
